{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1182798-the-art-of-sorcery-converted-sorcery-spells-for-third-edition","id":1182798,"title":"The Art of Sorcery - Converted Sorcery Spells for Third Edition!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-05T21:01:38-08:00","id":1182798,"title":"The Art of Sorcery - Converted Sorcery Spells for Third Edition!","content":"Hello everyone! I'm happy to present the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1L_EJYWDjRAocrOa79yIYOrRL7vp-KVxml_fR2bOYaLI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Art of Sorcery</a>, the revival and continuation of the Book of Three Circles project to convert spells from the previous editions to Exalted Third Edition! After taking charge of the project, I decided to rename it and expand it further with more spells and a pretty new format!<br /> <br /> In this project, you can find 35 new spells for sorcerers in the Third Edition, carefully converted to try and fit the design paradigm of the third edition.<br /> <br /> There are currently:<ul><li>20 New Terrestrial Spells</li> <li>10 New Celestial Spells</li> <li>5 New Solar Spells</li> </ul>All for you to use and enjoy! This has been a labor of love for me and I hope you all appreciate the results! I've heard playtesting notes from some friends who have been trying these spells out, but I am always interested in hearing more, please feel free to post your feedback, ideas or concerns in this thread, or to message them to me privately here on the Onyx Path Forums! I will try to answer whatever questions I can!<br /> <br /> I want the Art of Sorcery to be a community resource, so I am very interested in your feedback! I'd especially love to hear if you guys want to see more of this project, because I've discussed privately the possibilities of including some advice on storytelling sorcery, some rules hacks as well as more spells, sorcerous artifacts and sorcerous adversaries who make use of them. If any of those things would interest you, I'd love to hear it.<br /> <br /> This has been a lot of work over the last month or so, and I am super duper tired after spending my evening making final edits. I hope you guys enjoy it as much as I enjoyed writing it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Violet Green, Freelancer</b>","edited":{"userid":23657,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","user":"VioletDreamer","date":". 02-06-2018, 12:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":27}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","name":"VioletDreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-05T21:11:56-08:00","id":1182800,"title":"","content":"Thank you for sharing. More spells are always appreciated!<br /> The changelog is a very nice touch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/977-major","name":"Major","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar977_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T02:36:54-08:00","id":1182843,"title":"","content":"Great work!!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/437-shadowninja","name":"shadowninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-na