\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T02:19:21-08:00","id":1183207,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that's great.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T02:22:08-08:00","id":1183208,"title":"","content":"Love the control spells","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T04:43:17-08:00","id":1183884,"title":"","content":"I like what I see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1494-deranged-goblin","name":"Deranged Goblin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T05:23:06-08:00","id":1183895,"title":"","content":"Very nice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T02:18:26-08:00","id":1184302,"title":"","content":"I might use some of these with my next character (I kind of want to play a sorcerer, but I'm bored of the spells in the Core because I've seen them used so much now). If I do, I'll let you know how they are (it won't be for a few months though).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T05:01:20-08:00","id":1184334,"title":"","content":"I like this. You've been innovative with control spells and on my first reading nothing jumps out as troublesome which is a good start.<br /> <br /> Main point of concern is what's going to happen when I stack all the persistent effect defensive spells on the same character because I used to pull that trick in 2e, so I might try that for my next significant antagonist and get back to you with more detailed feedback. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T15:05:27-08:00","id":1184525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1182798-the-art-of-sorcery-converted-sorcery-spells-for-third-edition?p=1184334#post1184334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like this. You've been innovative with control spells and on my first reading nothing jumps out as troublesome which is a good start.<br /> <br /> Main point of concern is what's going to happen when I stack all the persistent effect defensive spells on the same character because I used to pull that trick in 2e, so I might try that for my next significant antagonist and get back to you with more detailed feedback.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd appreciate it! There aren't many defensive spells in the document, but the way they could stack is a concern of mine. I'm more than willing to make significant structural changes to spells or their control spell effects to improve the overall feeling and fun of the spells.<br /> <br /> For anyone interested, I'll be updating the document with some adjusted Sorcerous Mote costs for a couple spells tomorrow. If you have any feedback from using the spells or eyeballing them, I want to hear it from you! If there's one thing I want to say though, be attentive to the conditions of use for some spells, such as their <b>Duration</b> because this can be a factor of the &quot;balance&quot; of a spell. Just something to keep in mind!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Violet Green, Freelancer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","name":"VioletDreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T07:29:02-08:00","id":1185163,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if it's specifically still around, but there used to be an idea of Shaping, implying you could really only be Shaped one way at a time. So you couldn't stack up heaps of defensive magics without them undoing each other.<br /> <br /> Or maybe you'd just a'splode.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T14:50:49-08:00","id":1185358,"title":"","content":"Sorry for doing so a day late all, but made a small updated adjusting some costs for the higher level spells! The spells changed are all listed in the changelog!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Violet Green, Freelancer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","name":"VioletDreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T23:11:42-07:00","id":1209921,"title":"","content":"Nice, always love me some Total Annihilation. Also Flight of Separation and Impervious Sphere of Water, so good.<br /> <br /> Thank you for posting these.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8011-imadaman","name":"imadaman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8011_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T00:38:46-07:00","id":1209938,"title":"","content":"Not finished reading it yet but I like what I see so far.<br /> <br /> -Does Hardness apply against Assassin's Fatal Touch?<br /> <br /> -I'd probably reword the bit in Burning Eys of the Offender; the way you've got the parentheses placed initially confused me. &quot;(the greater of 2 or [the sorcerer's Essence]), perhaps? And rather than being treated as blinded, maybe characters who avert their gaze in combat should be made susceptible to a possible unexpected attack?<br /> <br /> -Coin of Distant Vision's control benefits seems to be missing an &quot;of&quot; between &quot;projection&quot; and &quot;her.&quot;<br /> <br /> -For Disguise of the New Face, you seem to have muddled the names of &quot;Keen Sight Technique&quot; and &quot;Unsurpassed Sight Discipline&quot; together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-22-2018, 03:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T11:06:50-07:00","id":1210097,"title":"","content":"Thank you for your kind words, guys! I\u2019ll make those edits as soon as I\u2019m back home from getting my lunch.<br /> <br /> I did not intend for Hardness to apply as protection against Assassin\u2019s Fatal Touch, but I\u2019ve been considering and reconsidering that spell\u2019s damage model for awhile, so I welcome opinions on whether it should apply or not!<br /> <br /> Something fun, Vance has mentioned that Impervious Sphere of Water and Virtuous Guardian of Flame are actually in What Fire Has Wrought, so after Tuesday I\u2019ll likely be removing my versions of those spells from my homebrew. Very excited to see what Vance came up with for both of them! There should be some other conversions in there that I was planning that you guys will appreciate too.<br /> <br /> For those interested, I have a couple of things that have been on my mind with these spells recently.<br /> <br /> 1. I want to ensure that Assassin\u2019s Fatal Touch has a model that feels in keeping with Third Edition\u2019s paradigm of charm/spell mechanics.<br /> <br /> 2. I would like to revise the mechanics for Burning Eyes of the Offender to make it function in a way that\u2019s more equitable but interesting.<br /> <br /> 3. I would like to make sure that Shadow Peacock Eyes does not step on the toes of Presence charms and the like, while still providing a means of sorcerous mesmerism.<br /> <br /> 4. I would like to make an effect like Mirror of Bending Light more in keeping with the stealth framework.<br /> <br /> 5. Revamp the mechanics of Internal Flame to ensure that it feels fully compliant with the combat mechanics of Third Edition while retaining that narrative flair.<br /> <br /> And more overhauls! If you have any feedback from actual play, I prize that! I want these spells to be fun, usable and as balanced as possible so as many groups as possible can comfortably use them.<br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Violet Green, Freelancer</b>","edited":{"userid":23657,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","user":"VioletDreamer","date":". 04-23-2018, 02:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","name":"VioletDreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T05:26:02-07:00","id":1210910,"title":"","content":"Posting quickly to encourage Kickstarter backers to go read the new spells, they\u2019re really really good!<br /> <br /> There are some great mechanical lessons for me in the spells that were converted that I had converted as well. I\u2019ll be removing my versions of Impervious Sphere of Water and Virtuous Guardian of Flame from this document for now.<br /> <br /> There\u2019s a lot of really intriguing new mechanical and conceptual precedents for Terrestrial Circle Sorcery that I\u2019ll be trying to incorporate into my own designs here. So stay tuned for some rewrites!<br /> <br /> As always, thank you all for your support!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Violet Green, Freelancer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","name":"VioletDreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}